<mxCell id="p0b1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:29.0px&quot;&gt;그림 2-1. VIP 광고 방식 : BGP 유지 (L2 는 참고)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#201E1F;strokeColor=#201E1F;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#F7F3EC;fontSize=24.0;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR,Noto Sans CJK KR,Malgun Gothic,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="14" width="1360" height="44" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p0b2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:22.0px&quot;&gt;LB IPAM 은 주소만 정함. 분산은 VIP 를 알리는 방식이 결정 → L2 면 VIP 당 노드 1대, BGP 면 광고 노드 전체 ECMP&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECDDB9;strokeColor=#D4A941;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#201E1F;fontSize=17.0;fontStyle=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR,Noto Sans CJK KR,Malgun Gothic,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="62" width="1360" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
