<mxCell id="p0b14" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:25.0px&quot;&gt;동작&lt;br&gt;· VIP 마다 lease 를 가진 노드 1대만 ARP 응답&lt;br&gt;· 그 VIP 의 모든 요청이 노드 1대로 인입&lt;br&gt;· 장애 시 lease 이전까지 끊김&lt;br&gt;· 패브릭 ECMP · iBGP/eBGP 설정과 무관하게 쏠림&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#CC501A;strokeColor=#CC501A;strokeWidth=3;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=20.0;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR,Noto Sans CJK KR,Malgun Gothic,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="500" width="620" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="p0b15" value="&lt;div style=&quot;line-height:21.5px&quot;&gt;확인&lt;br&gt;kubectl get ciliuml2announcementpolicy&lt;br&gt;kubectl -n kube-system get lease | grep cilium-l2announce&lt;br&gt;→ 있으면 L2 방식 = 불균형 1순위 원인&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEEAE4;strokeColor=#B6B3AE;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#201E1F;fontSize=16.5;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=6;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR,Noto Sans CJK KR,Malgun Gothic,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="50" y="666" width="620" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
